name: BOWSER'S CASTLE
world: 8
stage: 5
theme: castle
music: castle
time: 600
start: 2,7
startMode: stand
camera: scroll

;; BOWSER'S CASTLE (internal id 8-5; 0.4.55, LV54's approved design, scratchpad lv54/design.md): the real king's
;; castle, the campaign's last level, the one node of the VALLEY OF BOWSER page after World 8's 8-4 (owner, Oct 13).
;; Back in the Mushroom Kingdom: SMB's plain castle look. The player never sees "8-5": every label reads BOWSER'S
;; CASTLE (map/campaign-order.ts PLACE_NAMES). This file's presence turns the Valley on (valley-of-bowser.ts
;; VALLEY_LIVE). Campaign only: classic play never reaches it (8-4 is the end there). 36 screens, seven sections:
;;   A  0-79    ENTRANCE HALL        power block 1, a floor bar, the dais under a ceiling bar, two pits
;;   B  80-191  FIRE-BAR GAUNTLET    nine bars in a low corridor, the great wheel, two high pit rooms
;;   C  196-303 LAVA LAKE            islands, swinging, rising and twin lifts, a sinking step, stepping stones
;;   D  304-399 THE TWIN HALLS       a loop maze: high road out of hall 1, low road out of hall 2
;;   E  404-479 GUARD ROOM           power block 2, two hammer bros, on a balcony and on a guard post
;;   F  480-543 THE KING'S BRIDGE    power block 3, his flames fly in, the real Bowser (fire and hammers, his bar);
;;                                   campaign music `bowser-king` from column 480 (the `music` zone)
;;   G  544-575 THE AXE AND TOAD     Toad stands at the end (owner: no Peach here, she is found at Lost 4-4); the
;;                                   exit is the ending: the wand breaks, the false-ending credits, the rift
;; Five checkpoints, at 76, 190, 290, 408 and 474 (World.checkZones sends each one beyond the last sent).

[tiles]
